---
export const prerender = true;

import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { agent } from '../data/agent';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { project, verified } from '../data/project';

const projectName = verified(project.name) ?? 'the project featured on this website';
const contactEmail = site.legal.privacyContactEmail;
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Independent property marketing website"
  description="How enquiry details submitted through this website are collected, used, disclosed and retained, and how to withdraw consent or request access and correction."
  pathname="/privacy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  intro="How your personal data is handled when you enquire through this website."
>
  <h2>1. Who operates this website</h2>
  <p>
    This website is operated by {agent.fullName}, a salesperson registered with the Council for
    Estate Agencies (CEA registration {agent.ceaRegistrationNumber}), of {agent.agencyName} (estate agency
    licence {agent.agencyLicenceNumber}). {site.legal.independentDisclosureFull}
  </p>
  <p>
    For the purposes of the Personal Data Protection Act 2012 (PDPA), the salesperson named above
    and
    {' '}{agent.agencyName} handle the personal data you submit through this website. Enquiries about
    this policy may be sent to {contactEmail}.
  </p>

  <h2>2. What personal data is collected</h2>
  <p>When you submit the enquiry form, the following is collected:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name.</li>
    <li>Your Singapore mobile number.</li>
    <li>What you are enquiring about, and any unit types you select.</li>
    <li>Any message you choose to write.</li>
    <li>Your consent and the date and time it was given.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>The following technical and marketing-attribution data is also recorded with the enquiry:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Campaign parameters present in the page address (utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign,
      utm_term, utm_content) and advertising click identifiers (gclid, gbraid, wbraid).
    </li>
    <li>The page address you submitted from, and the referring page if your browser sent one.</li>
    <li>Your browser user-agent string and the date and time of submission.</li>
    <li>Your IP address, which is used transiently to apply submission rate limits.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Your name, phone number and message are never placed into a page address, an analytics event or
    an advertising tag.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Why it is collected and used</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your enquiry by WhatsApp, phone or email.</li>
    <li>To arrange a showflat appointment where you have asked for one.</li>
    <li>To send you the material you requested, such as a price list, floorplans or a brochure.</li>
    <li>To advise you on {projectName} and, where relevant, comparable alternatives.</li>
    <li>
      To meet record-keeping obligations that apply to CEA-registered salespersons and licensed
      estate agencies.
    </li>
    <li>To measure which advertising campaigns produce genuine enquiries.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Consent</h2>
  <p>
    The enquiry form asks for one consent, and the checkbox is not pre-ticked. It is required, and
    it covers contacting you about your enquiry and nothing else. The form does not collect consent
    to marketing, so submitting it is not a basis for sending you material about other launches.
    Your selection is recorded with the submission, together with a timestamp and the exact wording
    shown to you.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Withdrawing consent</h2>
  <p>
    You may withdraw consent at any time by writing to {contactEmail} or by replying to any message asking
    to be removed. Withdrawal is given effect within a reasonable period, and in any case within the timeframe
    required by the PDPA. Withdrawing consent means we will no longer be able to respond to your enquiry.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Access and correction</h2>
  <p>
    You may request access to the personal data held about you and information on how it has been
    used or disclosed in the past year, and you may ask for corrections. Write to {contactEmail}. A
    reasonable fee may apply to an access request, and you will be told of any fee before it is
    incurred. Verification of your identity may be required before a request is fulfilled.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Disclosure</h2>
  <p>Your personal data may be disclosed to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      {agent.agencyName}, for the purposes of supervision, compliance and record-keeping required of
      a licensed estate agency.
    </li>
    <li>
      The developer or its appointed marketing agents, where this is necessary to register your
      interest, arrange a showflat appointment or process a booking — and only to the extent needed
      for that purpose.
    </li>
    <li>
      Service providers that operate systems used to handle enquiries, such as web hosting, email
      delivery and customer relationship management. These providers act on instructions and are not
      permitted to use your data for their own purposes.
    </li>
    <li>Regulators, or any party, where disclosure is required by law.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Your personal data is not sold. Where data is transferred outside Singapore — for example to a
    hosting provider’s overseas servers — reasonable steps are taken to ensure a standard of
    protection comparable to the PDPA.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Cookies, analytics and advertising technologies</h2>
  <p>
    This website uses a minimal amount of client-side script. Where analytics or advertising tags
    are configured, they are governed by a consent banner and by Google Consent Mode: storage used
    for analytics and advertising is denied by default and only enabled if you accept. Declining
    leaves only what is strictly necessary for the website to function.
  </p>
  <p>The technologies that may be used, once configured, are:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Google Analytics 4, to understand how the page is used in aggregate.</li>
    <li>Google Ads conversion tracking, to measure which campaigns generate enquiries.</li>
    <li>Google Tag Manager, to manage the above.</li>
    <li>The Meta Pixel, which is loaded only after you accept.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    You can also control cookies through your browser settings, and you can opt out of Google
    Analytics using Google’s browser add-on. Blocking these does not affect your ability to use this
    website or to submit an enquiry.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Retention</h2>
  <p>
    Enquiry records are retained for as long as needed to respond to and follow up on the enquiry,
    and thereafter for as long as required to meet legal, regulatory and record-keeping obligations
    applicable to estate agency work in Singapore. Records that are no longer needed for any legal
    or business purpose are deleted or anonymised.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>[SPECIFY YOUR ACTUAL RETENTION PERIOD]</strong> — replace this with the retention period you
    genuinely apply, after checking the record-keeping requirements that apply to you and your agency.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Security</h2>
  <p>
    Reasonable technical and organisational measures are used to protect personal data, including
    encrypted transmission over HTTPS, credentials held in server-side environment variables rather
    than in page code, and access limited to those who need it. No method of transmission or storage
    is completely secure, and absolute security cannot be guaranteed.
  </p>

  <h2>11. Children</h2>
  <p>
    This website is intended for adults evaluating a residential property purchase. Personal data is
    not knowingly collected from anyone under 18.
  </p>

  <h2>12. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    This policy may be updated from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was
    last revised. Material changes will be reflected here before they take effect.
  </p>

  <h2>13. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions, access and correction requests, and withdrawals of consent should be sent to
    {' '}{contactEmail}, addressed to {agent.fullName}, {agent.agencyName}.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
